# Delver of Secrets with an empty library (CR 609.3): its upkeep ability still triggers and resolves, but there is no top
# card to look at or reveal, so Bot1 is asked nothing (the refusal of a "you may" question) and nothing is looked at. Bot1's
# deck is its seven-card opening hand. The script ends in that upkeep, with the ability resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Delver of Secrets
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delver of Secrets.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack = Delver of Secrets
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Step = Upkeep
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Looked = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Delver of Secrets
